# Intentionally minimal.
#
# The App's Appfile points fastlane's `supply`/`gradle` Play Store actions at a
# Google Play service-account key + package name. The Guardian SDK is a library
# published to Maven Central through Gradle (com.vanniktech.maven.publish), not the
# Play Store, so there is no Play Console identity to declare here. Kept as a
# placeholder so the fastlane/ layout matches the App and future Play-related
# config (if ever needed) has an obvious home.